<header><a href="/customers/<%= customer.account.id %>">Customer account</a><h1>Review subscription renewal</h1><p><%= customer.account.name %> · <%= customer.account.email %></p></header><section class="card"><p>This uses StockChief’s existing subscription engine. Cancellation stops renewal at the current period end and preserves customer records.</p><form method="post"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><label>Change<select name="action"><option value="cancel">Cancel at period end</option><option value="resume">Resume renewal</option></select></label><label>Reason<textarea name="reason" maxlength="1000" minlength="8" required></textarea></label><label class="check"><input type="checkbox" name="confirmed" value="yes" required>I approve this exact renewal change for this customer.</label><button class="primary">Apply approved renewal change</button></form></section>
